<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>El Chile Verde Mexican Food</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
  background: #0F3D2E;
  color: #F8F3E7;
}

h1, h2, h3 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
}

.container {
  width: 90%;
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: auto;
}

/* HERO */
.hero {
  height: 100vh;
  background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.6), rgba(0,0,0,0.6)),
  url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600891964599-f61ba0e24092') center/cover;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: 3rem;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.hero p {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 12px 25px;
  margin: 5px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 600;
  transition: 0.3s;
}

.btn-primary {
  background: #D4AF37;
  color: #000;
}

.btn-primary:hover {
  background: #fff;
}

.btn-outline {
  border: 2px solid #D4AF37;
  color: #D4AF37;
}

.btn-outline:hover {
  background: #D4AF37;
  color: #000;
}

/* SECTIONS */
section {
  padding: 80px 0;
}

.about, .menu, .reviews {
  text-align: center;
}

.about p {
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: 20px auto;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

/* MENU */
.menu-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.card {
  background: #123f31;
  padding: 20px;
  border-radius: 15px;
  transition: 0.3s;
}

.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-10px);
}

/* REVIEWS */
.review {
  background: #123f31;
  padding: 20px;
  margin: 10px;
  border-radius: 15px;
}

/* LOCATION */
.location {
  text-align: center;
}

/* FOOTER */
footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20px;
  background: #09281f;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>El Chile Verde</h1>
    <p>Authentic Mexican Flavor. Made With Heart.</p>
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Order Now</a>
    <a href="#location" class="btn btn-outline">Visit Us</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section class="about">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Not Just Food. It's Love in Every Bite.</h2>
    <p>
      El Chile Verde isn’t just another food spot — it’s where flavor meets passion.
      Known for generous portions, real ingredients, and unmatched hospitality,
      this is the place locals trust when they want something truly satisfying.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MENU -->
<section class="menu">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Customer Favorites</h2>
    <div class="menu-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Birria Tacos</h3>
        <p>Juicy, slow-cooked, dipped in rich consommé.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>California Burrito</h3>
        <p>Loaded and unforgettable.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Loaded Fries</h3>
        <p>Carne asada, cheese, flavor overload.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Quesadillas</h3>
        <p>Cheesy, crispy, made fresh.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- REVIEWS -->
<section class="reviews">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>What People Are Saying</h2>

    <div class="review">“They hooked it up with a free taco — I knew I picked the right spot.”</div>
    <div class="review">“Authentic, refreshing, and delicious — reminds us of Phoenix.”</div>
    <div class="review">“Super friendly, amazing food, and great prices. 10/10.”</div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- LOCATION -->
<section class="location" id="location">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Find Us</h2>
    <p>2200 Marigold Ave, Kissimmee, FL</p>
    <p>(407) 967-9418</p>
    <p>Open Daily — Closes at 9PM</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FOOTER -->
<footer>
  <p>© 2026 El Chile Verde Mexican Food</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
